diff --git a/HANDOFF.md b/HANDOFF.md
index 570a7f67..573515e3 100644
--- a/HANDOFF.md
+++ b/HANDOFF.md
@@ -50,3 +50,7 @@ The private overlay branch `mission-09-final-assembly` was last independently ve
 Overlay patch 29 fixes SDL2 header discovery by obtaining compiler flags from `pkg-config sdl2` and retains patch 28's Lua include path. It was validated locally in the exact 29-patch materialization: Linux `make -j2` completed, and the Metal shader adapter, SDL Metal layer lifecycle, texture-cache rewind, and touchscreen-math tests passed normally and under ASan/UBSan (leak detection disabled in this sandbox). The materialized tree is `f9722948b63a5263014a0d2eba973fc6240baf13`. These results do not establish an Apple compile or IPA.
 
 The workflow now runs `ios-arm64` independently of the host job. This keeps Linux regression failures visible without suppressing the separate Apple toolchain result. The next checkpoint must publish the updated overlay and dispatch one manual workflow. Until a successful macOS build and IPA validation are recorded, full iPhoneOS compilation and IPA packaging remain unverified.
+
+## Mission 10 dispatch status
+
+The patch-30 overlay checkpoint was pushed to `mission-09-final-assembly` as `5342cfc83b22c24f7d69b476fcaaa5bafda76456`; GitHub comparison confirmed the branch points to that commit. The workflow and `materialize.sh` were fetched from that ref and verified to contain independent `host`/`ios-arm64` jobs and expected source tree `bc7acad6eaf9d1b185c32ee75b953469bba14063`. No workflow run is associated with the commit. A single `gh workflow run ios-metal.yml --repo LawrenceBanes/sm64coopdx-metal-integration --ref mission-09-final-assembly` attempt failed with `error connecting to api.github.com`; `gh auth status` reports the cached token invalid and DNS resolution temporarily failing. The browser access host is unavailable, and the connected GitHub tool does not expose a manual workflow-dispatch operation. Therefore Apple compilation, IPA production, and IPA validation remain blocked pending restored authenticated network dispatch.
diff --git a/MISSION_10_PROGRESS.md b/MISSION_10_PROGRESS.md
